# Contact form delivery.
# Configure ONE of the two options below, then restart the dev server.
# With neither set, the contact form falls back to opening the visitor's mail
# client with everything pre-filled — so a message is never silently dropped.

# Option A — Formspree (https://formspree.io)
# Create a new form, copy its endpoint URL, paste it here:
VITE_FORMSPREE_ENDPOINT=

# Option B — Web3Forms (https://web3forms.com)
# Create an access key and paste it here:
VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
